      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If a hash build side EXCEEDS work_mem,\nit is partitioned and SPILLED here\n(batched hash join). Slower, but bounded\nmemory. This is the read-side analogue of\nan external sort.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If a hash build side EXCEEDS work_mem,\nit is partitioned and SPILLED here\n(batched hash join). Slower, but bounded\nmemory. This is the read-side analogue of\nan external sort.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
